  "scientific_conclusion": "Under strict validation-based model selection (zero test-loss monitoring), the empirical hierarchy remains identical: Sensor-Only LSTM outperforms Multimodal Fusion, which in turn outperforms Image-Only ResNet-50. Because public outdoor camera images lack sub-daily EXIF timestamps, pairing static midday photographs with dynamic telemetry introduces phase noise that degrades forecasting performance relative to pure telemetry."
